        "Note it pays only for direct content contribution to AI answers, not standard citations/links \u2014 temper monetization expectations from rising citation volume alone.",
        "Treat this pilot as a reason to avoid blocking AI crawlers until its impact and eligibility are better understood."
      ],
      "last_updated": "2026-09-25"
    },
    {
